      "text": "<span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-steinsaltz\" data-sugya-kind=\"steinsaltz\" data-sugya-id=\"117\" data-sentence-id=\"10\" data-steinsaltz-label=\"א\"></span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"10\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><big><strong><span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Beit Shammai, first and second-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"2756\" data-full-name=\"Beit Shammai\" data-name-he=\"בית שמאי\">בֵּית שַׁמַּאי</span></strong></big> אוֹמְרִים: הֶקְדֵּשׁ טָעוּת — הֶקְדֵּשׁ,",
